    "- ONS Populetion projections\n",
    "- Patients Registered at a GP practice\n",
    "\n",
    "Once we have the projections we add on the actual number of appointments from --> Appointments in General Practice.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Exam question/Objective:\n",
    "- Forecast for each projection scenario\n",
    "- Add on the actual appointments and predicted on same plot, to compare the overall trend line.\n",
    "- Trend plots for each projection scenario and each sub-icb."
